<title>GERMANY: Deutsche H1 op profit up 11.4 pct,gives breakdown.</title>
<headline>Deutsche H1 op profit up 11.4 pct,gives breakdown.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, July 23 - Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    2,860  up 11.4 pct</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    --retail and private clients	    872	vs n/a</p>
<p>    --corporate and institutional banking 901	vs n/a</p>
<p>    --investment banking			835	vs n/a</p>
<p>    --group services			    205 loss vs n/a</p>
<p>    --other/consolidation		     457	vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Deutsche Bank AG . Deutsche noted that as its divisional structure was introduced in 1996, there are no comparative figures for the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
